+/*
+ * Build an address space root.  Only the kernel half of the kernel PML4 is
+ * carried over: the low half is private to the new address space and the
+ * bootstrap identity map (PML4[0]) is deliberately dropped, since no
+ * process may run with the kernel identity-mapped.
